# 8.2 LADDER — STAGE 4 roll 2, LEGS 3 AND 4 ONLY, run concurrently.
#
# Split out of ladder_stage4.cases so the two remaining legs run alongside
# stage4b's legs 1-2 instead of queueing behind them. Safe to split because
# relation pooling was removed on 2026-07-19 (user rule: any leg-to-leg
# sharing is benchmark farming) — every leg is fully self-contained, with
# its own rundir, log and D4J_CHECKOUT_ROOT, so a leg's result does not
# depend on which suite it ran in or what ran beside it.
#
#   Leg 3: Math-2 CORRECT (SOFix) — the agreement-side test on the one
#          receiver where admission is proven (admitted twice).
#   Leg 4: Math-53 CORRECT (Arja) — the always-clean LIVE GUARD.
#
# Gates unchanged: STAGE4-HOW-TO-READ.md, S4-a..S4-f. S4-a (any clean-leg
# accusation traceable to the mechanism) remains a HARD STOP.
MODEL="gpt-5.4"
COMMON="-n 5 -m 12 --fuzz_timeout 20 --verify_timeout 20 --verify_relations --synthesize_relations --replay_relations_on_patched --rule_compile_repair --reference_impl"
CASES=(
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/SOFix/Math/patch1-Math-2-SOFix.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/Arja/Math/patch1-Math-53-Arja.patch"
)
